    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the belly of the Leviathan, a colossal steampunk airship that has mysteriously lost altitude. The central engine room is a labyrinth of hissing pipes, ticking clockwork, and copper terminals. To restart the main boiler and synthesize the master control mechanism, you must navigate the complex network of aetheric data engines. Many machines are interdependent, requiring precise inputs from other contraptions to function. Trace the flow of information through the brass machinery, activate the sequential mechanisms, and restore power before the ship plummets into the smog-filled abyss below.",
